{\pard\sb360\sa120\keepn\b SIEVE modules \u183? built and specified\par}
{\pard\sa160 SIEVE (Kalanoski 2026) is the Level 3 warrant audit: it reports whether the claims match the evidence offered, never whether the paper is worth publishing. No pointer, no flag. The modules follow the validity typology the field already uses, and the modality router selects which apply.\par}
